  "vibe": "Fog #1a2026 that never lifts — this is and it animated world runs on every beat, statements and CTA included. Bone #ece8dc type, phosphor-mint #9fe8c4 accents, one amber #e8a23c lantern. Grenze Gotisch sets a gothic display over a Spectral serif body. The world: two translucent ghosts rise slowly out of the bottom of frame, swaying and fading as they climb; a lantern hangs at the right rocking ±10° with its flame pulsing at 6Hz; three headstones sit on a ground band; two sheets of bone-tinted mist breathe up and down; eight stars twinkle at fixed points. Cards, tiles and the stat numerals all carry a mint glow. Motion is deliberately unhurried — drowse titles, half a degree of roll, a slow vertical drift and dolly. Mechanics: a sightings feed, an EMF needle gauge, a swipeable route stack, and a typed guide's note.",
